    {
      "id": "71779b1a-3660-47ec-84b8-ea6611fb0919",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-26T05:30:01.811Z",
      "author": "youssef",
      "text": "If I could borrow a moment from eternity, I would spend it looking into your eyes, hoping to understand how one person could hold so much beauty within a single soul. And if the heavens ever asked me what love looked like, I would simply whisper your name, for even the greatest poets could never find words worthy of describing what my heart feels for you.",
